flowchart TB
  accTitle: Moonbase runtime data flow
  accDescr: Managed coding workers use the authenticated server, project floors, queue, terminal host, and native CLI. Existing Neural Bridge runtimes supply a private observation snapshot through a bounded read-only projection, with no dispatch path back to those specialists.
  Browser["Private Moonbase browser"]
  Server["Authenticated Node server"]
  Floors["Project floors and work queue"]
  PTY["Terminal host and screen mirror"]
  CLI["Native coding CLI or shell"]
  Existing["Existing Neural Bridge runtimes"]
  Snapshot["Private observation snapshot"]
  Reader["Bounded read-only projection"]
  Browser <-->|"HTTP and WebSocket"| Server
  Server <--> Floors
  Floors <--> PTY
  PTY <--> CLI
  Existing -->|"Minimal observations"| Snapshot
  Snapshot --> Reader
  Reader --> Server
